        {
          "title": "电",
          "content": "<p>视剧《权力的游戏》就是一部莎士比亚戏剧，加上许多僵尸电影的元素。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/game-of-thrones-a-battle-of-reality-versus-fantasy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《权力的游戏：现实与幻想》</a></p>",
          "links": [
